+
+Source `7678c535` and `ea05bccb` reject Windows reserved device components (`CON`, `NUL`, `COM1`–`COM9`, `LPT1`–`LPT9`, `PRN`, `AUX`) and trailing-dot worker path components before returning an approved private narration manifest; added negative regression cases using the existing compiler. This is **source-only, untested locally** because GitHub clone DNS is unavailable. Exact-head four-job PR CI and real FFmpeg CPU audio mix remain unverified. Prior PR run #43428478335 had FFmpeg and Python failures (not 4/4). Protected ZIP #650 remains independent and must not be bypassed. **Next action:** run `python -m unittest discover -s tests/media -p test_feature4_voicestudio_handoff.py`, then `video-engine/ci.sh` on a CPU-capable checkout, inspect exact-head PR jobs, repair owned failures, and leave #322 draft until review and green CI.
