+
+F4-owned source commits `360a83bd9d4b933f42b26b284b8d5026919d91f0` and `43bfc48148034d6509eb72f8f1bd27da77c287ea` reject compiler bundle entries that point another media asset ID at the same approved private VoiceStudio WAV bucket/key, even when worker staging paths differ. Added regression `test_compiler_cannot_alias_private_voice_object_as_other_media`. This is **source-only**, not hosted or rendered acceptance. Earlier PR CI run #43446547127: Supabase and frontend passed, Python and FFmpeg failed; exact-head 4/4 for this batch not yet observed. Protected ZIP #650 must not be bypassed.
+
+**Next owned action:** inspect FFmpeg harness failure at `video-engine/ci.sh`, execute `python -m unittest discover -s tests/media -p test_feature4_voicestudio_handoff.py` and real CPU WAV→AAC Reel render on a checkout, repair F4-owned failures, then verify one exact-head 4/4 run. Parent #322 remains draft; no main merge until review and full acceptance.
